(d) the measures taken to accelerate the installation and commissioning of Kavach across the Indian Railways network?

(a) the salient features of the Bharat Audyogik Vikas Yojana (BHAVYA) for developing plug-and-play industrial parks across the country and the criteria adopted for selection of parks under the first phase;
